Fast_Tiff_Write (external dependency)
-------------------------------------
Required for motion-correction TIFF writing (Fast_BigTiff_Write).

Source: https://github.com/rharkes/Fast_Tiff_Write
Pin to commit: ddd50c3286ff5b013d1f0478e8a5bd0d60978a75
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (or later)
Authors: R. Harkes; BigTIFF support by O. Hernandez

Clone and check out that commit, then add the package to the MATLAB path.
Do not use a later upstream revision without verifying TIFF orientation
compatibility with GIAnT (see repository README).


