dftregistration_clipped.m
-------------------------
Path: dependencies/alignment/dftregistration_clipped.m

Modified from Manuel Guizar's dftregistration.m (MathWorks File Exchange
submission 18401, "Efficient subpixel image registration by cross-
correlation", version 2, 2016).

Algorithm citation:
  Manuel Guizar-Sicairos, Samuel T. Thurman, and James R. Fienup,
  "Efficient subpixel image registration algorithms," Opt. Lett. 33,
