GIAnT modifications relative to File Exchange dftregistration.m:
  - Renamed entry point; added required argument clip (max shift).
  - Zeros cross-correlation outside a centered clip window before peak
    search (whole-pixel and coarse partial-pixel paths).
  - Peak location uses max(real(CC)) instead of max(CC).


